## Why This Is Asked

Assesses practical E2E skills: gating UX with feature flags, deterministic tests, data seeding, and test isolation using Cypress or Playwright.

## Key Concepts

- Feature flags and gating
- Test data seeding per run
- LocalStorage state as idempotence marker
- Network/mocks to deterministically simulate flag responses
- Time-bounded execution for beginner scenarios

## Code Example

```javascript
// Playwright skeleton
test('onboarding respects flag', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.route('**/flags**', r => r.fulfill({ status: 200, body: JSON.stringify({ onboarding: true }) }));
  await page.goto('https://app.local/');
  await expect(page.locator('#onboard-modal')).toBeVisible();
  await page.locator('#finish').click();
  const stored = await page.evaluate(() => localStorage.getItem('onboarding_complete'));
  expect(stored).toBe('true');
  await page.reload();
  await expect(page.locator('#onboard-modal')).toBeHidden();
});
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you extend this to multi-tenant setups with per-tenant flag overrides?
- How would you ensure the test remains reliable when the flag toggles during a session?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests critical authorization paths, data-loss prevention, and audit integrity in multi-tenant setups, plus resilience to flaky services and retention policies.

## Key Concepts

- RBAC and DLP enforcement across tenants
- Tamper-evident audit logs (sequencing, signatures/HMAC)
- End-to-end data export redaction
- Seeds and mocks for deterministic, isolated tests
- Flaky service handling and time-based retention checks

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo end-to-end test sketch (Playwright/Cypress-agnostic)
async function testRBACAndDLP() {
  const t = seedTenant('tenantA');
  const uOwner = seedUser(t, 'owner');
  const uEditor = seedUser(t, 'editor');
  const uAuditor = seedUser(t, 'auditor');
  const admin = seedUser(t, 'admin');

  // Owner creates a share with PII
  await login(uOwner);
  await createShare({ tenant: t.id, data: 'PII' });

  // Editor attempts restricted action
  await login(uEditor);
  assertAccessDenied(editShare(t.id));

  // Auditor reads audit trail
  await login(uAuditor);
  assertAuditIncludes(t.id, 'READ', uAuditor.id);

  // Admin exports with redaction
  await login(admin);
  const exportPayload = await exportData(t.id);
  assertRedacts(exportPayload, ['PII']);
  // Verify tamper-evident log
  assertTamperEvidence(t.id);
}
```

